p>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今天是个多云的日子。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8931398\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">曇る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くもる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">天空阴云；乌云密布；天气转阴；蒙上雾气；起雾；变得模糊；表情阴沉；神情黯淡；面容忧郁；（能剧面具）微微向下倾斜（表示悲伤、哀痛等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146006\"><ruby>蒸気<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でメガネが<ruby>曇<rp>(</rp><rt>くも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在蒸汽中,眼镜变得模糊。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悔しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くやしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">懊悔的；遗憾的；沮丧的；恼火的；气恼的；令人沮丧的；令人恼火的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175912\"><ruby>決勝戦<rp>(</rp><rt>けっしょうせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>負<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けるほど<ruby>悔<rp>(</rp><rt>くや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいものはない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有什么比在决赛中输得更可悲。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悔やむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くやむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哀悼；悲叹；懊悔；遗憾；悔恨</span>