ら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなっていることに<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がついた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我注意到周围已经变得黑暗了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暮らし</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くらし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生活方式；生活；生计；日常生活</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193195\">もっと<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>暮<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしができますように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">希望能有更好的生活。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">クラシック</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">古典音乐；经典的；古典的；经典作品；古典著作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225611\">クラシックはありません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有经典。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">クラス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">班级；课程；阶级；等级</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234637\">あいつはクラスでいちばんのまぬけだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是课堂上最愚蠢的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暮らす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">くらす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\".